wolfstoneextract (1.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added script to ecwolf.wl6 which changes pushwall movement to three tiles.
    The engine in Wolfstone 3D/Elite Hans doesn't fix the three tile pushwall
    movement at 70fps, but instead modifies some of the maps to account for
    it. More importantly, while Wolfstone 3D does not depend on it, the levels
    in Elite Hans are designed around three tile pushwall movement.
  * Added detection of GOG version of Wolfenstein II.
  * Added support for multiple Steam libraries on Windows.
  * Fixed issues with optimizing ooz on recent compilers.
  * Minor adjustments in wording to clarify usage.

 -- Braden Obrzut <admin@maniacsvault.net>  Fri, 13 May 2022 23:01:00 -0500

